    "7:_": "G) [siman 2] The citizens of the city who sold in the siman 20, etc. and afi' at the beginning, it is permissible to sell in the siman 20 in order to buy a box and sell it Dankt Idi Desipa Nekt Lia Daifcha, Afi' already sold the ark, you must not buy in its image in the siman 20 and the Dok there, in the Gemara, Perishah O. 3 and 3. The Rambam means that it is not permissible in the siman 20 to raise his blood with a serious sanctity already in the 11th chapter of the Hebrew Gemara, and also in the 17th chapter of the siman 10, and he wrote in the name of the rabbi, and also in the name of the Rambam, in the beginning of the siman 10.",
