    "7:ח": "(8) (ח) Not allowed to sell. If they don't want to buy in a different image in a different color to illustrate the crime or who want to buy a grave holiness (KM Baran in the name of the Ramban) and Amash Sd in the name of the Rambam and KM CJ A.S. and in the Begum there, and Iiri when they don't have another BHC and AbiD C. RNB SA: The writing of the M.B. Seaman 33 on the site of the Dla Chachihi many Dathi Malama is called Kfar Af On the back of Dashchihi, many people pass and return from time to time, since they do not regularly pass through the city, but pass and return through Arai, it is called a village. Indeed, any place that is frequented by many people who do not pray there, such as a place where merchants gather there frequently for goods, or a place where there is a great sage who gathers there many who need him and his teachings, vol. They were not helped by other village cases, and even on the back that the language of the Rash and Ri'u means Dachal that many come to pray there. I realized that I was the only one who knew me, and I knew that I was the only one who was in Naoho:",
    "7:ט": "(9) (ט) without announcement. Daha Efi' to give as a gift is permitted per the siman 19 (Hashab'a) and further Dain requires a declaration except when he comes to charge others, but when we sell our own thing it is not a matter of declaration (Ran siman 25):",
