    "10:ב": "(2) (ב) And there are those who forbid. And according to him, even a Zeta in the MA and a member of the city are forbidden to sell their blood and use their blood unless it is to study Torah, etc. And from all of the above-mentioned Dabatshemishi's, the only one is allowed to sell their blood and use their blood, the main thing is proven by the Rabbis of Damari' that one does not sell a Sabbatical except to study Torah, etc. The Rabb except that he wrote there, in the siman 19, also in the Shamishi' and Tsa, and it is possible in the Dmash, there are those who forbid Kai only the Tsa, and as in the 4th Sessi, ar. B.D. Siman R.F.A.S.H.:",
