    "11:ד": "(4) (ד) Even by Zeta. Even in the status of the people of the city (Ref and the Rash and the Haran) and even on the back of dhama'ot, it is permissible to remove them as per the siman 17 from any place, the sanctity of the beit haknesset must apply to the mutt and then to remove the mutt, refer to Shekelim 4 and Shavuot page 10:",
