    "15:ה": "(5) (ה) And what they said in the sanctity of Heaven Dassor to erase the 14th sign of the 12th Duff, which was written not for the sake of sanctity, but for the purpose of correction, it is forbidden to erase it, and refer to the association of Mail Tzadka, 323, in the name of a bright face, to whitewash the writing of the High Court with its above results. And refer to the Rabbinical book of the foundations of the Torah 11:11 and Halacha 15, there is a name on his flesh that means it was not even written for the name of holiness. Israel wrote in the sanctification that we will not intend to sanctify him:",
